  <item>
    <title>写作特别档：我和我那不太熟的写作技巧</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6756ddbf17cd5416adb3179c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6756ddbf17cd5416adb3179c</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 09 Dec 2024 13:01:01 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好呀，欢迎大家回来创意剥壳第五期。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期我们将围饶着考研，谈论大家的写作小技巧和小妙招，帮助大家找到写作的小秘诀。</span></p><span></span><p><span>★本期时间轴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="182">03:02</a>:考前都会读哪些小短篇来模仿和积累。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="870">14:30</a>:模仿大作家还是模仿“小人物”。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1250">20:50</a>:创写必备铁砂掌——重新回归纸笔写作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1395">23:15</a>:没事哒、没事哒、没事哒，考场上心态的快速调整。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2410">40:10</a>:太不懂和太懂都是陷阱，保持稳定、平和的状态才是王。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2460">41:00</a>:跨考别急，到了考场上嫡嫡嫡学生也都一样。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2690">44:50</a>:考场写作的风格的选择。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2810">46:50</a>:把一个主题写出一部书的美感。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3040">50:40</a>:大胆尝试or按部就班，考场上写作技巧的抉择。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3145">52:25</a>:欢迎来到轰炸区，考场上满满的雷点。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3510">58:30</a>:别光写了！聪明的人都这么干…</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3700">1:01:40</a>:必听！不听就像考试没带笔！</span></p><span></span><p><span>★制作人员</span></p><span></span><p><span>策划：小金&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>主持人：小金</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：羽萱 丹妮 娜丹 雪婵 小棘</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑： 璐璐</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面：雪丽</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你喜欢《创意剥壳》，欢迎订阅、转发、留言，让更多朋友听到我们吧！也欢迎大家积极给我们提建议💗</span></p>]]></description>
