    <title>“vol.1 考研让我重新定义奢侈？睡了一个channel的觉”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66f6a8c86c7f8177868a3fc5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66f6a8c86c7f8177868a3fc5</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 27 Sep 2024 12:44:55 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，我们是就读于创意写作专业的研一新生。</span></p><span></span><p><span>首期节目想和大家一起来聊聊我们的考研路，</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望能给大家指点迷津，也祝大家一战成硕。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>你会听到：</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="411">06:51</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;怎么选目标院校？（看学校/学费/招生人数/城市）</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="621">10:21</a> 专业选择问题？为什么选择这个专业？(本专业 or跨考)&nbsp;</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="820">13:40</a> 从几月份开始准备考研？有没有必要拉长战线？</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1005">16:45</a> 如何避免外界干扰，选择宿舍还是外出租房？</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1241">20:41</a> 当别人在查漏补缺的时候，我在女娲补天。(考研进度管理）</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a> 背背，背背，背背oh~忘了(考研高效背书小技巧分享)&nbsp;</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2240">37:20</a> 考研，你还我妈生脊椎！(考研过程中生病及应对)&nbsp;</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>希望本期节目能够抚慰到各位正在考研或者在准备其他重要考试的朋友们。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>没关系，慢慢来，</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>创意剥壳陪你一起遇到更有趣的世界。</span></p>]]></description>
